(2850383, 398612, 48389, '<td valign="top">IMHO A neat idea but for me the composition doesn''t work. The ''light'' parts are too blown out and ''wires'' seem to be a little blurry. I do like the colour and lighting on the piece in the lower right handside :o)</td>', 'IMHO A neat idea but for me the composition doesn''t work. The ''light'' parts are too blown out and ''wires'' seem to be a little blurry. I do like the colour and lighting on the piece in the lower right handside :o)', '2006-09-20 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850388, 396324, 48389, '<td valign="top">Erm, Electricity? Difficult for me to see how this has anything to do with the challenge title. Ignoring the challenge title I do like the choice of B&amp;W but feel there needs to be a lot more detail in the ripples. (IMHO)</td>', 'Erm, Electricity? Difficult for me to see how this has anything to do with the challenge title. Ignoring the challenge title I do like the choice of B&W but feel there needs to be a lot more detail in the ripples. (IMHO)', '2006-09-20 10:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850394, 398060, 48389, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I would have been tempted to crop all of the lamp on the right handside out of the shot as I think its a little distracting. I do like the light on the post against the colour of the sky :o)</td>', 'Great idea, I would have been tempted to crop all of the lamp on the right handside out of the shot as I think its a little distracting. I do like the light on the post against the colour of the sky :o)', '2006-09-20 10:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850421, 398458, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like this, I think the texture on the B/G wall really helps the shot but if I was really picky I would have liked the ''outlet'' to be straight :o) (IMHO)</td>', 'I like this, I think the texture on the B/G wall really helps the shot but if I was really picky I would have liked the ''outlet'' to be straight :o) (IMHO)', '2006-09-20 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850442, 398304, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and the editing works well but I am not sure about the crop (IMHO). There is some nice light on the buttons and its definitely a different take on Electricity</td>', 'I like the DOF and the editing works well but I am not sure about the crop (IMHO). There is some nice light on the buttons and its definitely a different take on Electricity', '2006-09-20 10:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850447, 397236, 48389, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I like the placement of the tower in the frame. Colours are nice and the silhouette effect works well :o)</td>', 'Nice composition, I like the placement of the tower in the frame. Colours are nice and the silhouette effect works well :o)', '2006-09-20 10:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850456, 398318, 48389, '<td valign="top">LOL I''m glad I''m not the only one who has this mess underneath their desk!! I actually like the composition and light in this shot as well, its always good one a photo makes you smile :o)</td>', 'LOL I''m glad I''m not the only one who has this mess underneath their desk!! I actually like the composition and light in this shot as well, its always good one a photo makes you smile :o)', '2006-09-20 10:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2850469, 396086, 30049, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t have gotten out of your vehicle to get a more unique angle and also to avoid the dirty windshield.  Nice take on the theme.  Good luck.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t have gotten out of your vehicle to get a more unique angle and also to avoid the dirty windshield.  Nice take on the theme.  Good luck.', '2006-09-20 10:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
