(2850718, 398127, 18073, '<td valign="top">The image is very small, so it makes the image hard to judge fairly.  For me the composition is poor, you need to take care of details like a straight horizon but also need to spend more time considering what your subject is.<br/> <br/>Obviously your intention was to make a feature of the power lines, but the are very small in the frame and so it isn''t clear whether they are the focus point of the image or not.<br/> <br/>Hope I haven''t rained on your parade too much, keep shooting and your eye will improve, just remember, composition is everything!</td>', 'The image is very small, so it makes the image hard to judge fairly.  For me the composition is poor, you need to take care of details like a straight horizon but also need to spend more time considering what your subject is. Obviously your intention was to make a feature of the power lines, but the are very small in the frame and so it isn''t clear whether they are the focus point of the image or not. Hope I haven''t rained on your parade too much, keep shooting and your eye will improve, just remember, composition is everything!', '2006-09-20 11:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
