(2851353, 398378, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the way those lines are illuminated.  At first I thought they were very long lens flare streaks from a helicopter mounted light.  ;^)  Serious.  The angle and bold B/W work fine with this.  Looks like an old-time image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the way those lines are illuminated.  At first I thought they were very long lens flare streaks from a helicopter mounted light.  ;^)  Serious.  The angle and bold B/W work fine with this.  Looks like an old-time image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-20 15:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
