(2851381, 397244, 30049, '<td valign="top">Makes my hair stand on end just looking at this!  ;^)  You have an "inside" advantage.  He-he.</td>', 'Makes my hair stand on end just looking at this!  ;^)  You have an "inside" advantage.  He-he.', '2006-09-20 15:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
