(2852389, 398619, 60477, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of the shot...not sure why the lights seem so dull. For example the bulbs on the light stand look the same as the folks in the crowd. Hope you team won. I would try this shot again sometime.</td>', 'I love the idea of the shot...not sure why the lights seem so dull. For example the bulbs on the light stand look the same as the folks in the crowd. Hope you team won. I would try this shot again sometime.', '2006-09-20 21:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
