(2856932, 398440, 42389, '<td valign="top">well-composed image! Flame reflection in the welders mask would make this picture perfect. Really love those sparks.</td>', 'well-composed image! Flame reflection in the welders mask would make this picture perfect. Really love those sparks.', '2006-09-22 14:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856947, 398361, 30049, '<td valign="top">Is that heat shimmer that is making much of this look blurry, particularly the towers?  It''s a nice perspective on this and the image is interesting to look at.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Is that heat shimmer that is making much of this look blurry, particularly the towers?  It''s a nice perspective on this and the image is interesting to look at.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-22 14:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856950, 398460, 42389, '<td valign="top">works for me. Really like the perspective and those intersecting lines. Well done!</td>', 'works for me. Really like the perspective and those intersecting lines. Well done!', '2006-09-22 14:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856953, 397287, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good use of tone to create the effect you have with the background blending with her pants (I''ll need to view at home on calibrated monitor).  Her placement in this gives a sense of motion, like she''s walking out of the image.  To me that''s a good thing in this scenario, although many will argue that your subject should have space to "move into".  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good use of tone to create the effect you have with the background blending with her pants (I''ll need to view at home on calibrated monitor).  Her placement in this gives a sense of motion, like she''s walking out of the image.  To me that''s a good thing in this scenario, although many will argue that your subject should have space to "move into".  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-09-22 14:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856974, 398327, 43774, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge. Odd, I can see a lot of artifacts or smudges on the left side in the sky.....did you take this through a window?</td>', 'Fits the challenge. Odd, I can see a lot of artifacts or smudges on the left side in the sky.....did you take this through a window?', '2006-09-22 14:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2856975, 398519, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. Not sure I like the blue/purple tint though.</td>', 'Cool photo. Not sure I like the blue/purple tint though.', '2006-09-22 14:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2857034, 398397, 47020, '<td valign="top">Presuming that your subject is the light post, and not something more subtle that I''m missing, I think this shot would be greatly improved (especially within the context of this challenge) by taking it sometime when the light was actually on...  Generally, though, I''m finding this image to be just too busy to know what to look at, really -- which perhaps is your point?</td>', 'Presuming that your subject is the light post, and not something more subtle that I''m missing, I think this shot would be greatly improved (especially within the context of this challenge) by taking it sometime when the light was actually on...  Generally, though, I''m finding this image to be just too busy to know what to look at, really -- which perhaps is your point?', '2006-09-22 15:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2857049, 398440, 47020, '<td valign="top">I think this shot might be much improved with a longer exposure, to highlight the sparks more.  Just a stop or two, to be compensated with aperture or a neutral density filter.  Still, I like it.</td>', 'I think this shot might be much improved with a longer exposure, to highlight the sparks more.  Just a stop or two, to be compensated with aperture or a neutral density filter.  Still, I like it.', '2006-09-22 15:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2857051, 397810, 47020, '<td valign="top">excellent execution, excellent title, both!  Well done!</td>', 'excellent execution, excellent title, both!  Well done!', '2006-09-22 15:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2857202, 397285, 48389, '<td valign="top">It definitely has electricity and the water and hills behind add extra interest but feel the composition is overall a bit bland (IMHO)</td>', 'It definitely has electricity and the water and hills behind add extra interest but feel the composition is overall a bit bland (IMHO)', '2006-09-22 17:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2857206, 398618, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but feel that the light and sheet music are a little blown out and the background is a little busy. The light on the girls face and the piano keys is the nice though :o) (IMHO)</td>', 'I like the idea but feel that the light and sheet music are a little blown out and the background is a little busy. The light on the girls face and the piano keys is the nice though :o) (IMHO)', '2006-09-22 17:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2857246, 396387, 48389, '<td valign="top">Well definitely says electricity but for me the composition is very bland, no real interest to keep the viewers attention (IMHO) Possibly a different angle and more attention on the empty socket would help?</td>', 'Well definitely says electricity but for me the composition is very bland, no real interest to keep the viewers attention (IMHO) Possibly a different angle and more attention on the empty socket would help?', '2006-09-22 17:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2857251, 398071, 48389, '<td valign="top">Great title! To me the white balance/blue levels seem a little off as everything has a shade of blue to it. I think the composition could have been improved if you had the pole more to the left of the frame and just had the one bird in the shot (IMHO)</td>', 'Great title! To me the white balance/blue levels seem a little off as everything has a shade of blue to it. I think the composition could have been improved if you had the pole more to the left of the frame and just had the one bird in the shot (IMHO)', '2006-09-22 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2857254, 398460, 48389, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and editing on this shots. You have placed the tower and lines really well in the frame and clouds have a great ''moody'' feel to them :o)</td>', 'Love the composition and editing on this shots. You have placed the tower and lines really well in the frame and clouds have a great ''moody'' feel to them :o)', '2006-09-22 17:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
