(2866334, 398016, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the composition overall is pretty good.  I like the trees included on the one side.  I think, however, that this image would be a good candidate for a bit of PSing, to get the colours in the sky to show and glow a bit more.  ~7</td>', 'I like the idea, and the composition overall is pretty good.  I like the trees included on the one side.  I think, however, that this image would be a good candidate for a bit of PSing, to get the colours in the sky to show and glow a bit more.  ~7', '2006-09-26 15:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2866343, 397802, 5112, '<td valign="top">Neat image, it sort of grows on you.  I also sort of wish it were a bit straighter (it looks ever so slightly tilted to me, but I may be wrong), and that you''d gone in just a touch closer (maybe to the edge of the cherry at top left and right under the green leaf at the top).  That''s just an idea though.  The bottom right hand side looks slightly blurry.  I like the image though.  ~7</td>', 'Neat image, it sort of grows on you.  I also sort of wish it were a bit straighter (it looks ever so slightly tilted to me, but I may be wrong), and that you''d gone in just a touch closer (maybe to the edge of the cherry at top left and right under the green leaf at the top).  That''s just an idea though.  The bottom right hand side looks slightly blurry.  I like the image though.  ~7', '2006-09-26 15:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2866347, 396037, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I wish it were slightly larger.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I wish it were slightly larger.', '2006-09-26 15:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
