(2867684, 398300, 28742, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, one entry, no comments made or received no other participation on the site and a very impossible-in-basic looking image. I''ll reserve congratulations until after verification. If all goes well, I shall eat crow. Until then - Hmmmmm...</td>', 'Hmmmm, one entry, no comments made or received no other participation on the site and a very impossible-in-basic looking image. I''ll reserve congratulations until after verification. If all goes well, I shall eat crow. Until then - Hmmmmm...', '2006-09-27 01:19:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2867689, 398116, 61552, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  After taking this shot, I found I had to crop out the stadium lights above it or all your attention would be drawn to them, enough to destroy the image.  I left only the glow below them, and, of course, that lone light on the building.  Anyway, without ELECTRICITY, golf is impossible at night.  Thank you for all the comments, they ALL are appreciated.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-27 00:21:26.</i></td>', 'Interesting!  After taking this shot, I found I had to crop out the stadium lights above it or all your attention would be drawn to them, enough to destroy the image.  I left only the glow below them, and, of course, that lone light on the building.  Anyway, without ELECTRICITY, golf is impossible at night.  Thank you for all the comments, they ALL are appreciated.', '2006-09-27 01:19:58.000000', '2006-09-27 01:21:26.000000', 0),
