(2869834, 397940, 31637, '<td valign="top">I voted this a 4. It''s a photo that fits the challenge very well, but a cityscape like this would of benefitted from a better crop , city should be the line that cuts the photo in half. It''s too high up and blackness is everywhere. Try this again with a new perspective and a higher ISO setting. The exposure is good though.</td>', 'I voted this a 4. It''s a photo that fits the challenge very well, but a cityscape like this would of benefitted from a better crop , city should be the line that cuts the photo in half. It''s too high up and blackness is everywhere. Try this again with a new perspective and a higher ISO setting. The exposure is good though.', '2006-09-27 16:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
