(2869997, 397810, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, Guðrún!!!! I haven''t had a chance to look at the entries from this challenge yet - what a great sight it was for me to look here and see you just about at a ribbon. You''ll definitely beat me there. This is such a perfect entry, lovely colors and composition. Congratulations on a personal best to top it all off. Yay for G!</td>', 'Wonderful, Guðrún!!!! I haven''t had a chance to look at the entries from this challenge yet - what a great sight it was for me to look here and see you just about at a ribbon. You''ll definitely beat me there. This is such a perfect entry, lovely colors and composition. Congratulations on a personal best to top it all off. Yay for G!', '2006-09-27 18:00:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2870008, 398291, 31133, '<td valign="top">Whooohoo! Congrats on a top shelf shot with that new camera and sweet lens - and above all, a personal best! The movement here is great. Amazing that it was handheld. Way to go, K.</td>', 'Whooohoo! Congrats on a top shelf shot with that new camera and sweet lens - and above all, a personal best! The movement here is great. Amazing that it was handheld. Way to go, K.', '2006-09-27 18:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
