(2885669, 398397, 3936, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>Focus is excellent.  I would suggest using depth of field to soften the background, as the busy appearance of the building across the street distracts heavily.<br/> <br/>I agree with the other commenters that the subject is too centered, and would have been nice to see it lighted.  <br/> <br/>Color, saturation and hue are done well.  Lighting is a bit flat and cool.  (Looks like an overcast day.)  Though there is some shadow, which if accurate, says high noon, which is a bad time for photos.<br/> <br/>Too bad you couldn''t stage some bicycles in front of the light pole.  That would have further communicated the assimilated theme.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: Focus is excellent.  I would suggest using depth of field to soften the background, as the busy appearance of the building across the street distracts heavily. I agree with the other commenters that the subject is too centered, and would have been nice to see it lighted.   Color, saturation and hue are done well.  Lighting is a bit flat and cool.  (Looks like an overcast day.)  Though there is some shadow, which if accurate, says high noon, which is a bad time for photos. Too bad you couldn''t stage some bicycles in front of the light pole.  That would have further communicated the assimilated theme.', '2006-10-02 02:00:58.000000', NULL, 0),
