(3501448, 398315, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is an okay night shot...but I have to say that I''m a little surprised it scored as well as it did.  It appears a little crooked to me and there just doesn''t seem to be much art to this shot...not a whole lot of interest to the subject, composition and presentation.  I''m sure it was a cool thing to see in person, but I find this to be just average as a photograph.  Apparently, many others like it more than me :)   So I will say congratulations on a nice finish and score with this one.</td>', 'This is an okay night shot...but I have to say that I''m a little surprised it scored as well as it did.  It appears a little crooked to me and there just doesn''t seem to be much art to this shot...not a whole lot of interest to the subject, composition and presentation.  I''m sure it was a cool thing to see in person, but I find this to be just average as a photograph.  Apparently, many others like it more than me :)   So I will say congratulations on a nice finish and score with this one.', '2007-03-31 02:32:24.000000', NULL, 0),
