(3960064, 397946, 63267, '<td valign="top">I thnk you have a great idea here. Have you thought about reshooting it?  Maybe a bit tighter on the composition and darken the rest of the area to make the spark plug and spark stand out?  I see some noise which makes me thing that you boosted the exposure or used the shadow/highlight tool. EIther way that did leave you a little flat on the lighting.<br/> <br/>Still even with all of this I don''t think you deserved your sub 4 score.  <br/> <br/>Let me know if you ever try this one agan, I would like to see it.</td>', 'I thnk you have a great idea here. Have you thought about reshooting it?  Maybe a bit tighter on the composition and darken the rest of the area to make the spark plug and spark stand out?  I see some noise which makes me thing that you boosted the exposure or used the shadow/highlight tool. EIther way that did leave you a little flat on the lighting. Still even with all of this I don''t think you deserved your sub 4 score.   Let me know if you ever try this one agan, I would like to see it.', '2007-08-02 01:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4286818, 398139, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines of the lights on the ceiling<br/></td>', 'I like the leading lines of the lights on the ceiling', '2007-12-03 20:32:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4327347, 398291, 60165, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by whiterook:</b></div><hr/><i> Should used a higher speed and film.  Subject matter is uninterested. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Higher speed and film? Don''t carry a film camera. Higher speed? Then I would not have gotten the same effect of the train in motion.<br/> <br/>And you are right, the train was not interested in me at all. Not that I could tell :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by whiterook: Should used a higher speed and film.  Subject matter is uninterested.   Higher speed and film? Don''t carry a film camera. Higher speed? Then I would not have gotten the same effect of the train in motion. And you are right, the train was not interested in me at all. Not that I could tell :-)', '2007-12-21 01:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
